[{"id":"fastapi-0141-dev-vs-run","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"FastAPI","tags":["CLI","运行模式"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(二)快速开始与开发环境.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(二)快速开始与开发环境","articlePath":"posts/1c968b87/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/fastapi/FastAPI(二)快速开始与开发环境.md","articleTitle":"FastAPI(二)快速开始与开发环境","articlePath":"posts/1c968b87/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fastapi dev\u003c/code> 与 \u003ccode>fastapi run\u003c/code> 的运行边界是什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>dev\u003c/code> 面向开发并启用重载，\u003ccode>run\u003c/code> 面向稳定运行且不启用开发重载；二者都需要可定位的 ASGI 入口。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>开发模式把文件变化转换成重启事件，适合快速反馈；运行模式只负责把已确定的应用交给服务器。两者都不能替代生产拓扑：生产还要决定进程数、代理、探针、日志和密钥来源。判断时同时看启动日志和第二次 HTTP 请求，不能仅凭命令名称推断。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-IP-007","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["NAT","端点"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(三)IP 与网络寻址","articlePath":"posts/5bd659bc/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":17,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>NAT 映射通常改变哪些信息？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>它可以把内部地址和端口映射为外部地址和端口，并维护返回流量所需的状态。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>NAT 不等于防火墙，也不能自动解决应用 payload 中的内部地址、入站发布和端到端语义问题。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>NAT 的状态可以画成一个端点映射，而不是“安全开关”：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>内部端点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>外部端点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>返回包如何定位\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>192.168.10.10:53000\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>198.51.100.8:41000\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>依赖 NAT 状态表\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>映射只改变地址/端口和回程状态；访问控制、应用认证、payload 中的地址以及入站发布仍要单独处理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-NET-003","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["封装","解封装"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(二)网络分层与局域网","articlePath":"posts/474f4d81/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":18,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>发送端和接收端的封装、解封装分别做什么？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>发送端逐层为载荷增加本层字段，接收端按协议栈逐层读取并消费字段，再把剩余载荷交给上层。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>交换机通常只需读取当前帧的链路字段，路由器会处理 IP 和下一跳，最终主机才把应用数据交给 HTTP、DNS 等应用协议。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>可以把一次传输压缩成“每层只消费自己的字段”这条线：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight text\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">应用数据\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ↓ 加上传输层字段（端口、序列信息）\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">传输层载荷\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ↓ 加上网络层字段（源/目标 IP）\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">网络层载荷\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">  ↓ 加上链路层字段（源/目标 MAC）\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">以太网帧\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>接收端按相反方向读取这些字段；中间交换机只需要完成当前链路的转发，不能因为它转发了一个帧就推断 HTTP 已经成功。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-ADV-FAQ-002","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["DoH","DoT","DNS"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(八)进阶路线.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(八)进阶路线","articlePath":"posts/e470b049/"}],"articleIndex":7,"articleCount":9,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>DoH 比 DoT 更安全吗？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能脱离威胁模型比较。二者都可以保护客户端到解析器的查询传输，但信任、日志、端点策略、治理和回退行为决定实际风险。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>DoH 更像 HTTPS，DoT 的专用端口更容易被识别和治理；加密查询不等于匿名化所有访问。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>两者都保护客户端到解析器的查询传输，但治理形态不同：\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>方案\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>外观\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>需要额外核对\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DoH\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>HTTPS 流量\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>端点、代理、日志和回退\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>DoT\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>专用 TLS 端口\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>端口策略、识别和端点\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>加密查询不等于匿名化访问，也不自动改变解析器的信任与留存策略。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"CN-MOD-FAQ-001","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP/2","队头阻塞","QUIC"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(六)HTTPS 与现代 HTTP","articlePath":"posts/36cb963b/"}],"articleIndex":9,"articleCount":13,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP/2 是否完全消除了队头阻塞？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>没有。HTTP/2 的多个 stream 共享 TCP 连接，缓解了 HTTP 层一个响应阻塞其他响应的问题，但 TCP 丢包仍会影响连接上的后续字节。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>HTTP/2 把多个 stream 的帧交错放进同一条 TCP 连接。这样一个慢的 HTTP 响应不必阻塞其他 stream 的应用层排队，但 TCP 仍按序交付字节；其中一个 TCP 包丢失时，连接上后续 stream 的字节也可能一起等待重传。HTTP/3 使用 QUIC 的独立 stream，能缩小这种传输层影响，但 DNS、代理、应用队列和单个 stream 内部仍可能产生延迟。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>所以“HTTP/2 消除了队头阻塞”只说对了一半：它缓解了 HTTP 层的队头阻塞，没有消除 TCP 层和应用层的所有阻塞。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"linux-a7-jobs-pgrep","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Linux","tags":["作业控制","查找"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/linux/Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理.md","articleTitle":"Linux(七)进程任务与服务管理","articlePath":"posts/23ca1872/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>jobs 和 pgrep 的观察对象有什么不同？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>jobs 看当前 Bash 会话的作业，pgrep 查系统进程；后台作业可能脱离当前 Shell。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>先看当前会话，再看全系统：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight bash\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">sleep\u003c/span> 60 &amp;\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">jobs\u003c/span> -l                 \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 当前 Bash 的作业表\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">pgrep -af \u003cspan class=\"string\">&#x27;sleep 60&#x27;\u003c/span>    \u003cspan class=\"comment\"># 系统进程表中的匹配\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">ps -o pid,ppid,\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">tty\u003c/span>,\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">stat\u003c/span>,cmd -p \u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;\u003cspan class=\"subst\">$(pgrep -n -f &#x27;sleep 60&#x27;)\u003c/span>&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>\u003ccode>jobs\u003c/code> 依赖当前 Bash 的 job-control 表，关闭终端或交给 systemd 后就不再是可靠入口；\u003ccode>pgrep\u003c/code>、\u003ccode>ps\u003c/code> 和 \u003ccode>systemctl\u003c/code> 才能跨会话观察。\u003ccode>nohup\u003c/code> 只改变挂断信号和输出处理，并不提供生命周期、重启或日志治理。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-wait-strategy","type":"choice","priority":1,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["等待","稳定性"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(四)断言与等待.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(四)断言与等待","articlePath":"posts/70bae600/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>提交后状态会异步变成“完成”，哪种等待方式最合适？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>Web-first 断言直接等待业务可观察结果，并在条件提前成立时立即结束。\u003c/p>\n\u003cp>固定睡眠只等待时间，不等待条件：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;button&quot;\u003c/span>, name=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;提交&quot;\u003c/span>).click()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">expect(page.get_by_role(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;status&quot;\u003c/span>)).to_have_text(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;完成&quot;\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>状态提前完成时断言会立即通过；状态仍未满足时，它会保留重试和超时证据。sleep 五秒可能浪费时间，也可能在慢环境中仍然过早返回。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>固定等待五秒\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>等待全站网络空闲\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>使用 \u003ccode>expect(status).to_have_text(&quot;完成&quot;)\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]},{"id":"pytest-scope-mismatch","type":"basic","priority":1,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["作用域"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期","articlePath":"posts/97e28b51/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(五)Fixture 与资源生命周期","articlePath":"posts/97e28b51/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>ScopeMismatch 为什么发生，应该从哪里修？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>长作用域 Fixture 依赖短作用域 Fixture 时发生；应重新划分资源边界，而不是强行捕获异常。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>作用域必须沿依赖链保持兼容：长生命周期的对象不能依赖更短生命周期的对象，否则它会在后续测试中持有已经失效的依赖。\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">4\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">5\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">6\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">7\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">8\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture(\u003cspan class=\"params\">scope=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;session&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">app_config\u003c/span>():\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> load_config()\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"meta\">@pytest.fixture(\u003cspan class=\"params\">scope=\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;function&quot;\u003c/span>\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">def\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"title function_\">user\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"params\">app_config\u003c/span>):\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">    \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">return\u003c/span> create_user(app_config)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>如果把 \u003ccode>user\u003c/code> 反过来注入 session Fixture，就会触发 \u003ccode>ScopeMismatch\u003c/code>。修复方式不是捕获异常，而是提升真正不可变的配置、缩短外层 Fixture，或让整条需要隔离的链保持 function 作用域。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"pytest-approx-boundary","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Pytest","tags":["数值"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断","articlePath":"posts/ac715911/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/pytest/Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断.md","articleTitle":"Pytest(四)断言与结果诊断","articlePath":"posts/ac715911/"}],"articleIndex":3,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>pytest.approx\u003c/code> 的相对和绝对容差如何共同决定结果？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>相对容差按期望值缩放，绝对容差提供接近零时的下限；\u003ccode>nan_ok\u003c/code> 只在 NaN 合法时开启。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>approx\u003c/code> 接受误差当量：相对误差按期望值缩放，绝对误差为接近零的结果提供下限。可以用一个小实验看出两者的作用：\u003c/p>\n\u003cfigure class=\"highlight python\">\u003ctable>\u003ctr>\u003ctd class=\"gutter\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">1\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">2\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">3\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003ctd class=\"code\">\u003cpre>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">1.000001\u003c/span> == pytest.approx(\u003cspan class=\"number\">1.0\u003c/span>, rel=\u003cspan class=\"number\">1e-5\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"number\">0.0000004\u003c/span> == pytest.approx(\u003cspan class=\"number\">0.0\u003c/span>, \u003cspan class=\"built_in\">abs\u003c/span>=\u003cspan class=\"number\">1e-6\u003c/span>)\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003cspan class=\"line\">\u003cspan class=\"keyword\">assert\u003c/span> \u003cspan class=\"keyword\">not\u003c/span> (\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">float\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;nan&quot;\u003c/span>) == pytest.approx(\u003cspan class=\"built_in\">float\u003c/span>(\u003cspan class=\"string\">&quot;nan&quot;\u003c/span>)))\u003c/span>\u003cbr>\u003c/pre>\u003c/td>\u003c/tr>\u003c/table>\u003c/figure>\n\u003cp>先把业务精度换成 \u003ccode>rel\u003c/code>/\u003ccode>abs\u003c/code>，再决定是否允许 \u003ccode>nan_ok=True\u003c/code>；放大容差只能让错误消失，不能证明计算正确。接近零的金额、比例或坐标通常要显式给 \u003ccode>abs\u003c/code>。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"testing-basics-a02-concept-1","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"测试基础","tags":["测试原理"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(二)测试原理与质量观.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(二)测试原理与质量观","articlePath":"posts/90ac9409/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/testing-basics/测试基础(二)测试原理与质量观.md","articleTitle":"测试基础(二)测试原理与质量观","articlePath":"posts/90ac9409/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":3,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>测试和调试有什么区别？测试人员能不能调试？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>测试评价工作产品、发现缺陷或触发失效；调试定位原因并消除缺陷。它们是活动区别，同一人可以承担两者，修复后仍需验证。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>锁定账户仍登录成功时，先记录账户状态、输入、实际会话与预期，这是测试证据。检查代码并修复遗漏分支属于调试。\u003c/p>\n\u003cdiv class=\"table-container\">\n\u003ctable>\n\u003cthead>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003cth>时点\u003c/th>\n\u003cth>还缺的证据\u003c/th>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/thead>\n\u003ctbody>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>已复现失败\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>原因仍需要分析\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>已提交修复\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>原失败条件是否通过\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003ctr>\n\u003ctd>原条件已通过\u003c/td>\n\u003ctd>相关正常登录和解锁行为是否受影响\u003c/td>\n\u003c/tr>\n\u003c/tbody>\n\u003c/table>\n\u003c/div>\n\u003cp>静态评审直接发现需求矛盾时，修正矛盾不需要先复现运行失败。岗位名称不能替代对活动和证据的区分。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]